AB  - Modeling the glucose separation process was researched based on support vector machine to remove redundant sugar in the liquid medicine, Ophiopogon japonicas solution was the research object. In the alcohol precipitation process of glucose separation, the pH value prediction model of the liquid medicine was established by support vector regression(SVR). The model parameters were optimized by multi-population particle swarm optimization(MPSO) algorithm, the prediction precision of the optimized model meets the production requirements. In order to further verify the feasibility, the proposed model was compared with the BP neural network model on prediction precision. The results show that the model prediction is stable and accurate on training set and test set, which indicates that the proposed model is feasible to predict the pH value of the glucose separation process in traditional Chinese medicine solution. © 2019 IEEE.
