AB  - Expounding the implementation process of an online estimation system for glutamic acid bacterial concentration designed using LabVIEW with graphical programming language and BP neural network soft-sensing. By selecting parameters such as ventilation, sugar supplementation, pH, and temperature during the glutamic acid fermentation process as auxiliary variables for soft sensor modeling, the important biological parameter affecting the fermentation process and product quality, bacterial concentration, is determined as the target variable for softsensing modeling. The BP neural network in the machine learning toolkit provided by LabVIEW is called, and it is modeled by the BP neural network is trained and tested using sample data. Through simulation results analysis, it has been proven that soft-sensing system of LabVIEW can achieve online estimation of bacterial concentration in the glutamic acid fermentation process. © 2024 IEEE.
